#     alert     causes   short                               per  fatal   non-  why        num  seqs   seqs  long       
#idx  code      failure  description                        type  cases  fatal  nonfatal  seqs  fail  alone  description
#---  --------  -------  -----------------------------  --------  -----  -----  --------  ----  ----  -----  -----------
1     indf5lcc  no       INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_START     feature      0      2  -            1     0      0  alignment to homology model has low confidence at 5' boundary for feature that is or matches a CDS
#---  --------  -------  -----------------------------  --------  -----  -----  --------  ----  ----  -----  -----------
2     lowcovrg  yes      LOW_COVERAGE                   sequence      3      0  -            3     3      0  low sequence fraction with significant similarity to homology model
3     mutstart  yes      MUTATION_AT_START               feature      1      0  -            1     1      0  expected start codon could not be identified
4     mutendns  yes      MUTATION_AT_END                 feature      1      0  -            1     1      0  expected stop codon could not be identified, no in-frame stop codon exists 3' of predicted start codon
5     unexleng  yes      UNEXPECTED_LENGTH               feature      3      0  -            2     2      0  length of complete coding (CDS or mat_peptide) feature is not a multiple of 3
6     cdsstopn  yes      CDS_HAS_STOP_CODON              feature      2      0  -            2     2      0  in-frame stop codon exists 5' of stop position predicted by homology to reference
7     fsthicft  yes      POSSIBLE_FRAMESHIFT_HIGH_CONF   feature      9      0  -            9     9      2  high confidence possible frameshift in CDS (frame not restored before end)
8     fsthicfi  yes      POSSIBLE_FRAMESHIFT_HIGH_CONF   feature      6      0  -            6     6      5  high confidence possible frameshift in CDS (frame restored before end)
9     peptrans  yes      PEPTIDE_TRANSLATION_PROBLEM     feature      8      0  -            4     4      0  mat_peptide may not be translated because its parent CDS has a problem
10    indf3gap  yes      INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_END       feature      2      0  -            2     2      0  alignment to homology model is a gap at 3' boundary
